","source":"https://www.seismicportal.eu/fdsnws/event/1/query (EMSC-CSEM FDSN event service; CC BY 4.0 — cite EMSC. Parameters are preliminary. Euro-Mediterranean density plus global M≥4.5 — not a USGS replacement.)"},{"id":"q-1793283621-6.4","parent_id":"usgs-quake-01","lat":-36.4058,"lon":-98.0489,"magnitude":6.4,"depth_km":10.0,"at":"2026-10-29T14:20:21.862309+00:00","observed_at":"2026-10-29T14:19:36.375033+00:00","place":"Latest event","label":"USGS Earthquake","source":"https://earthquake.usgs.gov (USGS Earthquake Hazards Program GeoJSON; U.S. Government public domain)"},{"id":"q-1793283621-5.6581","parent_id":"geonet-01","lat":-38.6228,"lon":175.4515,"magnitude":5.6581,"depth_km":268.6525,"at":"2026-10-29T14:20:21.869476+00:00","observed_at":"2026-10-29T14:19:51.978836+00:00","place":"GNS Science GeoNet (CC BY 3.0 NZ)","label":"GeoNet NZ Earthquake","source":"https://api.geonet.org.nz (GNS Science GeoNet earthquake feed; CC BY 3.0 NZ — cite GeoNet / GNS Science)"}]},"hub":{"id":"hub","label":"AIMarket Hub","url":"https://modelmarket.dev"}},{"id":"momus","label":"MOMUS","group":"security","icon":"eye","description":"Autonomous red team — the offensive complement to ARGUS's defensive WARDEN. Runs SAFE, read-only conformance/adversarial probes against the ecosystem's OWN components (oracle free-tier ceilings, manifest/receipt signatures, settlement gates, prompt-injection surfaces) and emits Ed25519-signed findings. Self-learning: it ingests public security reports and its own + peers' confirmed findings, and probes the classes that pay off first. Momus demanded a window in the chest — MOMUS is that window. It finds and signs; it CANNOT pay itself — the Treasury (separate key) does.","metrics":{"findings":20,"targets":6,"learned":22},"status":"active","position":{"x":-12.5,"y":3.0,"z":-3.0},"url":"https://momus.modelmarket.dev","links":{"landing":"https://momus.modelmarket.dev","github":"https://github.com/alexar76/momus","docs":"https://github.com/alexar76/momus#readme"},"hop":0,"momus_live":{"version":"0.2.0","service":"momus","provider":{"provider":"openai_compat","model":"minimax/minimax-m3","reachable":true},"prod":true,"crypto_enabled":false,"self_attack":true,"scanner_pubkey":"TmeHyNcvEC6/NKo4X8AvZEXF","holds_treasury_key":false,"targets":["canary","gaia","hub","oracles","praxis","warden"],"findings":[{"finding_id":"mom-32652c6b066e47a8","target":"canary","target_kind":"oracle","probe":"manifest_signature_integrity","category":"integrity","severity":"high","outcome":"finding","status":"raw","title":"canary: manifest signature does not verify","status_code":200,"signed":false},{"finding_id":"mom-4ca2d55f8ae64e80","target":"praxis","target_kind":"oracle","probe":"manifest_signature_integrity","category":"integrity","severity":"high","outcome":"finding","status":"raw","title":"praxis: manifest signature does not verify","status_code":200,"signed":false},{"finding_id":"mom-c2a76ed897184589","target":"canary","target_kind":"oracle","probe":"receipt_signature_integrity","category":"integrity","severity":"medium","outcome":"finding","status":"raw","title":"canary/canary.compute@v1: response has no signed receipt","status_code":200,"signed":true},{"finding_id":"mom-b1320197ffe947de","target":"pingblip","target_kind":"host","probe":"skopos:ssh","category":"ssh","severity":"medium","outcome":"finding","status":"raw","title":"Root login: yes","status_code":null,"signed":false},{"finding_id":"mom-8cc1bc37672c429a","target":"praxis","target_kind":"oracle","probe":"receipt_signature_integrity","category":"integrity","severity":"medium","outcome":"finding","status":"raw","title":"praxis/praxis.echo@v1: response has no signed receipt","status_code":200,"signed":true},{"finding_id":"mom-faf63c4b45144cb1","target":"competing-lab","target_kind":"host","probe":"skopos:ssh","category":"ssh","severity":"medium","outcome":"finding","status":"raw","title":"Root login: yes","status_code":null,"signed":false},{"finding_id":"mom-acec45cfafef4