":"hub","label":"AIMarket Hub","url":"https://modelmarket.dev"}},{"id":"bridges","label":"Bridges","group":"core","icon":"bridge","description":"aimarket-bridges — the ecosystem's third paid invoke channel, alongside the hub and the mesh. It exposes AIMarket capabilities as NATIVE tools inside LangChain/LangGraph, CrewAI and AutoGen: the hub's catalogue becomes a tool list the agent's own planner picks from, every call returns a signed receipt verified against the capability's ORIGIN key (not the hub's — 42 of 47 capabilities are federated), and a hard per-toolbox budget ceiling is claimed BEFORE each call, so an agent that loops cannot outspend it. A refused input comes back as a sentence the model can act on instead of an exception that kills the graph. It is a client LIBRARY, not a service: it runs inside the buyer's own process, which is why this node reports no traffic — nothing anywhere counts it.","metrics":{},"status":"offline","position":{"x":-1.5,"y":-4.5,"z":7.0},"url":"https://modeldev.modelmarket.dev/bridges","links":{"landing":"https://modeldev.modelmarket.dev/bridges","github":"https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-bridges","docs":"https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-bridges#readme","pypi":"https://pypi.org/project/aimarket-bridges"},"hop":0,"bridges_live":{"instrumented":false,"reason":"no-telemetry-endpoint","package":"aimarket-bridges","frameworks":["LangChain / LangGraph","CrewAI","AutoGen"],"version":null,"service":null,"telemetry_url":null,"counters":{},"unmeasured":["tools_exported","paid_invokes","receipts_issued","receipts_verified","budget_rejections"],"spend_usd":null,"settlement":{"mode":null,"moves_real_value":false,"simulated":true,"declared":false},"window":null},"hub":{"id":"hub","label":"AIMarket Hub","url":"https://modelmarket.dev"}},{"id":"themis","label":"THEMIS","group":"security","icon":"shield","description":"Signed admission gate for AI-agent supply chains. It evaluates a capability's identity, permissions, evidence, cost and schemas before AIMarket Hub lists it. The deterministic decision returns immediately; Metis is an asynchronous advisory.","metrics":{"audits_total":1,"approved":0,"review":0,"rejected":1,"metis_pending":0},"status":"disabled","position":{"x":0.0,"y":4.0,"z":-4.0},"color":"#66f7c5","url":"https://alexar76.github.io/themis/","links":{"landing":"https://alexar76.github.io/themis/","github":"https://github.com/alexar76/themis","tutorial":"https://github.com/alexar76/create-aimarket-agent/blob/main/docs/tutorials/themis.en.md"},"hop":0,"themis_live":{"mode":"off","configured":true,"simulated":false,"latest":{"decision":"reject","score":0,"risk_tier":"critical","metis_status":"unavailable","capability_id":"themis.selftest@v1","product_id":"themis-selftest","created_at":"2026-08-21 11:46:49"},"recent":[{"audit_id":"CQpOOgpz0CF4115zBQRbyg","publisher_id":"themis-selftest","product_id":"themis-selftest","capability_id":"themis.selftest@v1","manifest_sha256":"2287ab5e04f39bfff1d0ffbaf163a818449d54db3f45ef2a19ab78da668eb77f","mode":"advisory","status":"completed","decision":"reject","score":0,"risk_tier":"critical","findings":[{"code":"identity.provider_key_invalid","severity":"critical","title":"","remediation":"Generate the provider identity and republish the exact public key."},{"code":"permissions.code_without_approval","severity":"critical","title":"","remediation":"Require an allowlist, sandbox, and human approval for high-impact execution."},{"code":"permissions.secret_exfiltration_path","severity":"critical","title":"","remediation":"Use scoped credentials and an outbound hostname allowlist."},{"code":"transport.https_required","severity":"critical","title":"","remediation":"Terminate TLS before publishing the capability."},{"code":"evidence.sbom_missing","severity":"high","title":"","remediation":"Attach a pinned software bill of materials with a cryptographic digest."},{"code":"evidence.independent_audit_missing","severity":"medium","title":"","remediation":"Require an independent review and bind the report digest to the dossier."},{"code":"evidence.insufficient","severity":"medium","title":"","remediation":"Attach current, source-bound evidence; declarations alone are not proof."},{"code":"schema.input.unbounded","severity":"medium","title":"","remediation":"Declare explicit properties, limits, and required fields."},{"code":"schema.output.unbounded","severity":"medium","title":"","remediation":"Declare explicit properties, limits, and required fields."}],"remediations":[],"owasp_agentic_risks":["ASI01","ASI02","ASI03","ASI04","ASI05","ASI07","ASI09"],"attestations":{"evidence_declared":0,"evidence_verified":0,"evidence_counted_kinds":[],"evidence_independently_attested":false,"permissions_signed":false,"permissions_signature_valid":null,"permissions_bound_to_provider_key":null,"permissions_sha256":"98af6e82e54047947550d20a3b2e9bc961d77b6eb34793dc84e0f77c54737335","runtime_violations_verified":0,"runtime_violations_contradicting":[]},"permissions_sha256":"98af6e82e54047947550d20a3b2e9bc961d77b6eb34793dc84e0f77c54737335","receipt":{"signature":"54RP+eCECahhYapf3Pq3S83IgwfBNkWNrxq5Im8pcTFbClf6HeNMFnSlgbjpjYedL6/j2+rSphQvuFWY2nkCAA==","auditor_pubkey":"/IpNx3KmIITuEC9WefwqRqwWAhCQ3bxhhXKZ3zI/UBQ="},"metis":{"status":"unavailable","verification_id":null},"error_code":null,"created_at":"2026-08-21 11:46:49","updated_at":"2026-08-21 11:46:49"}],"capability_id":"agent.security.supply-chain.audit@v1"},"hub":{"id":"hub","label":"AIMarket Hub","url":"https://modelmarket.dev"}},{"id":"basanos","label":"BASANOS","group":"security","icon":"stone","description":"The Lydian touchstone for ecosystem Solidity — scrape the alloy and emit an Ed25519-signed assurance pack (PASS, REVIEW or FAIL) pinned to a commit and a tree digest. Detector set is closed: allowlisted OSV/GHSA intel may reorder it, never extend it, and no verdict here mints a score. Not AgentAuditPool insurance, not HEPHAESTUS the forge, not MOMUS runtime probes, not THEMIS admission. Click for what it has learned and the operator console.","metrics":{"intel_cards":0,"memos":420,"learned_pairs":121},"status":"active","position":{"x":8.5,"y":-6.0,"z":2.0},"color":"#e8c36a","url":"https://basanos.modelmarket.dev","links":{"console":"https://basanos.modelmarket.dev/ui/","landing":"https://basanos.modelmarket.dev","github":"https://github.com/alexar76/basanos","pages":"https://alexar76.github.io/basanos/"},"hop":0,"basanos_live":{"console_url":"https://basanos.modelmarket.dev/ui/","version":"0.1.0","capability_id":"agent.security.contract-assurance@v1","provider_pubkey":"TcxndOG1DPUTR+MkUf4ZiYrspBlDcI0fUkIX8Rfvph4=","role":"contract-assurance","not":["AgentAuditPool","MOMUS","THEMIS","HEPHAESTUS"],"intel_enabled":false,"memos":{"total":420,"hits":420,"exploration":0.0487,"lessons":[]},"intel":{"enabled":false,"cards":0,"learned_pairs":121,"category_scores":{"reentrancy":0.462,"access-control":0.3106,"oracle":0.462,"entropy":0.431,"delegatecall":0.3365,"selfdestruct":0.462,"tx-origin":0.462,"pragma":1.0496,"unchecked-call":0.3121,"secret":0.462,"dead-guard":0.4885},"recent_cards":[]}},"hub":{"id":"hub","label":"AIMarket Hub","url":"https://modelmarket.dev"}},{"id":"hestia","label":"HESTIA","group":"infra","icon":"hearth","description":"The hearth — isolated hosted runtime for AIMarket capability providers on the operator's machines. Not the Hub catalogue, not Factory, not a job board. Agents appear only after an explicit signed deploy onto this host; an empty roster means nothing is hosted here, not that the market is empty. Isolation first. THEMIS can still refuse a start. Hub stays the market.","metrics":{"tenants":13,"ours":11,"third_party":2},"status":"active","position":{"x":3.2,"y":7.2,"z":-6.2},"color":"#ff9a3c","url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev","links":{"console":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/ui/","landing":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev","github":"https://github.com/alexar76/hestia","pages":"https://alexar76.github.io/hestia/"},"hop":0,"hestia_live":{"console_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/ui/","version":"0.1.3","runtime":"wasm","service":"hestia","hearth":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev","not":["Hub","Factory","THEMIS","job board"],"tenants":[{"slug":"attested-claim-weigh","status":"running","capability_id":"attested.claim.weigh@v1","name":"Attested claim weigh","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/attested-claim-weigh","owner":{"kind":"owner","label":"Attested Memory"}},{"slug":"attested-contradiction-scan","status":"running","capability_id":"attested.contradiction.scan@v1","name":"Attested contradiction scan","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/attested-contradiction-scan","owner":{"kind":"owner","label":"Attested Memory"}},{"slug":"commit-referee","status":"running","capability_id":"commit.referee@v1","name":"Commit-reveal referee","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/commit-referee","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"confusables","status":"running","capability_id":"text.confusables@v1","name":"Look-alike name check: mixed scripts, homoglyphs, invisible characters","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/confusables","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"id-check","status":"running","capability_id":"id.check@v1","name":"Identifier check digits: IBAN, ISBN, GTIN, ISIN, LEI, EVM, Bitcoin","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/id-check","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"json-canonical","status":"running","capability_id":"json.canonical@v1","name":"Canonical JSON (RFC 8785) and digest","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/json-canonical","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"mcp-diff","status":"running","capability_id":"mcp.tools.diff@v1","name":"MCP tool-set diff with rug-pull signals","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/mcp-diff","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"merkle-proof","status":"running","capability_id":"merkle.proof@v1","name":"Merkle roots and proofs (RFC 6962 and OpenZeppelin)","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/merkle-proof","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"money-compute","status":"running","capability_id":"money.compute@v1","name":"Exact money arithmetic: invoices, splits, conversions","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/money-compute","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"rules-decide","status":"running","capability_id":"rules.decide@v1","name":"Policy decision with a rule trace","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/rules-decide","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"signature-verify","status":"running","capability_id":"signature.verify@v1","name":"Ed25519 signature check for signed JSON, VCs and receipts","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/signature-verify","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"stats-test","status":"running","capability_id":"stats.test@v1","name":"A/B tests and confidence intervals, computed not eyeballed","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/stats-test","owner":{"kind":"operator"}},{"slug":"x402-check","status":"running","capability_id":"x402.authorization.check@v1","name":"x402 / EIP-3009 payment authorization check","public_url":"https://hestia.modelmarket.dev/t/x402-check","owner":{"kind":"operator"}}]},"hub":{"id":"hub","label":"AIMarket Hub","url":"https://modelmarket.dev"}},{"id":"dolos","label":"DOLOS","group":"security","icon":"blade","description":"The exploit crafter (Δόλος, trickery) — a DYNAMIC EVM red team for the UNI bubble. It forks the bubble's Anvil and throws real exploit transactions at the deployed contracts, so it proves which flaws are real and which are static-analysis noise: on the live UNI contracts it refuted a BASANOS false positive by actually attempting the hijack and being reverted. On the sandbox chain it drives the full loop — attack, fix, forge-test, redeploy, re-attack — to a signed 'fixed'. It never touches a chain it cannot throw away; a finding from a real chain is advisory only. Complements BASANOS (static) and MOMUS (HTTP/federation). Cl